{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're bleeding out. Every kill adds seconds. Survive a top-down, procedurally generated maze where time is your #1 enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137680/extras/054cf0dc034494b08ecfb6b8a058f7ec.poster.avif?t=1760123122\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137680/extras/054cf0dc034494b08ecfb6b8a058f7ec.webm?t=1760123122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137680/extras/054cf0dc034494b08ecfb6b8a058f7ec.mp4?t=1760123122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive headfirst into roguelite chaos as you <strong>RUSH</strong> through procedurally-generated levels, each teeming with foes hungry for your blood. Mercilessly <strong>KILL</strong> everything that stands in your way to claim control of your own personal labyrinth of nightmares. <strong>REPEAT</strong> the challenge until victory is yours, or until your inevitable demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > RKR - Rush Kill Repeat FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Environments:</strong> Navigate through diverse environments such as slippery ice caves and dimly lit passages, each with its own unique music track, adding depth to your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Combat:</strong> Your enemies die in one shot. But so do you. Exercise precision and caution as you navigate through the maze, ensuring that every shot counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large Arsenal:</strong>\u00a0Discover new, powerful weapons to help push your journey further.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Mazes:</strong> Experience endless replayability with procedurally generated levels, ensuring that every run offers a fresh and unpredictable challenge.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Satisfied?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2137680/71f18ba5b6761b20c822013f3294f6a16d7a59d7.jpg"},{"name":"You're telling me this place has lights???","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2137680/d8137d950731e9dfdd0d1fc21739349c1cc67732.jpg"},{"name":"Obsessive.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2137680/c8b2ab4affafed115d95ef37672462ac3bad3f66.jpg"},{"name":"That's a lot of blood...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2137680/0cee9e52e02c293b59b5a2745bc0e37a7bf152c9.jpg"},{"name":"How are you still alive?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2137680/8171802bf5d87ed9083477d37b36700eb676db8c.jpg"},{"name":"What are you?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2137680/aee7de89aee62a3ecda83ea481a0eb88c284cd2a.jpg"},{"name":"Spooktacular Achievement!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2137680/9cac77ee25bb07b752b3ddd46535a126092abb3d.jpg"},{"name":"Level Challenge Complete - Classic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2137680/ad095722b7212e7abcb30dfc698700d6e3ea76e6.jpg"},{"name":"Level Challenge Complete - The Backrooms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2137680/1a106646676b023ad2345884d2f57f8f1c4baf48.jpg"},{"name":"Level Challenge Complete - Pixels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2137680/91353059ed9177e0c3a969e7c334b184d594e6e0.jpg"}],"total":29},"background":"https://store.akamai.steams