 victory is yours, or until your inevitable demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > RKR - Rush Kill Repeat FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Environments:</strong> Navigate through diverse environments such as slippery ice caves and dimly lit passages, each with its own unique music track, adding depth to your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Combat:</strong> Your enemies die in one shot. But so do you. Exercise precision and caution as you navigate through the maze, ensuring that every shot counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large Arsenal:</strong>\u00a0Discover new, powerful weapons to help push your journey further.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Mazes:</strong> Experience endless replayability with procedurally generated levels, ensuring that every run offers a fresh and unpredictable challenge.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Filip Budd"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137680/a1037b1301e14df6ff6c8109f629d6b88085a338/header.jpg?t=1760123122","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2137680/499085/89c43d954182399d83601544152eccda9114e251/1751080617/dash_av1.mpd?t=1664005477","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2137680/499085/89c43d954182399d83601544152eccda9114e251/1751080617/dash_h264.mpd?t=1664005477","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2137680/499085/89c43d954182399d83601544152eccda9114e251/1751080617/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1664005477","id":256907490,"name":"RKR Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256907490/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1664005477